      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Secret Manager**\n\nI've decided to use Google Cloud Secret Manager. Now I'll start implementing the provider-specific code. My next step involves reading a specific secret version or staged value. The file I'm creating is named `rotate_secret_version.py`.\n\n\n**Implementing Secret Access**\n\nI'm making progress on `rotate_secret_version.py`. I'm focusing on the implementation, specifically reading a secret version using Google Cloud Secret Manager. I've got the basic structure mapped out, and I'm currently adding imports and client initialization. This should enable access to the secret values.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
