      "data": {
        "text": "**Developing the Script**\n\nI've crafted `parse_json_secret.py`, integrating the required functions. My current work leverages `boto3` for AWS Secrets Manager interaction, providing a clear provider identifier. The code retrieves a secret by name, then parses it assuming a JSON string format. It is also designed to execute directly when run as a script via the `if __name__` block.\n\n\n**Finalizing the Implementation**\n\nI've finished the implementation of `parse_json_secret.py`. The script now includes example usage within an `if __name__` block, with placeholders for the secret name. The code also contains notes regarding the AWS region and credential configuration. I believe the script meets all requirements.\n\n\n",
